I don't think there's any real danger in controlled random teleport
kicking in when you're in a battle. After all, you use the same movement
keys to hit monsters that you use for pointing where to teleport, and you
can can keep on hitting the keys as long as you will. The game waits for
the '.' key as confirmation that you are ready with the pointing.
I think it's very unlikely to accidentally hit '.' while fighting, you
should notice the prompt and the cursor movement before that.
If you want to keep on fighting where you stand, just move the cursor back
before hitting '.'.

